#: e273ca0f2df34c3caacb9162260f2d26
msgid ""
"The board also has SH6P 1mm connector for digital FPV systems which has "
"UART6."
msgstr "该板还带有一个用于数字 FPV 系统的 SH6P 1mm 连接器，其上引出 UART6。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcuf405pro.rst:42
#: 2ed94e209c7c48cb961760622bac5de7 41e4246f0c0c48238031b7b66ac90659
#: 4d1f54d078184133999ba6b62117130b 60dcb896f38642ac8405ae8676227ff8
#: e428bb217adb423a8904016b4546b389
msgid ""
"Please note that the board will not enter DFU mode if the receiver is "
"connected to either USART1/USART3/USART4). If you have it soldered there due"
" to DMA requirements you will need to temporarily desolder the wire on the "
"FC's RX pad and solder it back after flashing."
msgstr ""
"请注意，如果接收机连接在 USART1/USART3/USART4 上，该板将无法进入 DFU 模式。如果因 DMA "
"需求已将其焊接在这些口上，则需要临时把飞控 RX 焊盘上的线焊下，刷写完成后再焊回。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcuf405pro.rst:44
#: 0d76f601110943feaa77df7a9ba9da5a 97f47351d27a454fa9aae7406d810ed3
