msgstr "SERIAL6 -> USART6（MSP DisplayPort，支持 DMA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcuf405pro.rst:52
#: 321fe09715ac42159f14b058d57e753f 40aa0fc5e8e94189b6f24f74a97994e3
#: 41d9a7e6616d473f92613a6ccb299e24 49b323a6428e4231807297710504fa76
#: c8a95b56cf794841b62ad3cb0bc11216
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcuf405pro.rst:53
#: 6f586c507e4b466e89f5db4068f3a91e 986f283c4564416f867beb66f9c0eea4
#: a25dbd1632044e14b22fb82159720e71 c9a7fa8cd60d4ceda304650d83f6458f
#: cb613168a86f42a4bc392e72d3b23e86
msgid ""
"RC input is best configured on the RX1/TX1 (USART1_RX/USART1_TX) pins due to"
" having full DMA capability and being mostly easy to access for desoldering "
"to enable DFU mode."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入最好配置在 RX1/TX1（USART1_RX/USART1_TX）引脚上，因为它们具备完整的 DMA 能力，而且为进入 DFU "
"模式而拆焊也比较方便。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcuf405pro.rst:55
#: 29e86a62a7b3479184ee19b9a0ba0396 8c8aaad52f124cf184ab57b909763b5d
#: a6adecc29f4f45e0a5c514adbf0bb1bf b7b1e99e7cef4c6b9ca8e34131e4c44b
#: d718000b28a647088c0ec9379411212d
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcuf405pro.rst:56
#: 7969c9b46e024ef88c6d9b7673f84f44 aa9f6c83be5544e985a07c640d7700fc
#: d29b8d808e904d60b3697ed6a248947b e5c3ff6d719e4cdcbcf45f3e891084ec
#: f9a57dab8f04437facb0113261a89b28
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to T1 and :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` "
"be set to “7”."
msgstr "FPort需连接T1，且须将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcuf405pro.rst:57
#: 2d7d19faab3b4864b9b4557491599127 3c6135c665e8419ab4260c633369d902
#: 5e235494ca6745d08d058a73a913c883 79ba1e08c14745db9d66250bf5f4bdad
#: e5e4ac58b55f416aba363d7cf9748143
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a T1 connection, in addition to R1, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` to “0”."
msgstr ""
"CRSF除需连接R1外，还需连接T1，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为 "
"「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcuf405pro.rst:58
#: 09132facd20048f19fd18bbc14f7f0ec 3060d5bbd1b745f4abe5e0cfb4e6cb7c
#: c85b61d928174d03b2da75d19fc1444d eaef61052c38408993f9a3e9dce3d9cb
#: f9cdce76189142bca903733867dfdbe1
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to T1 and automatically provides telemetry. Set "
":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` to “4”. Any UART can be used for RC "
"system connections in ArduPilot also, and is compatible with all protocols "
"except PPM. See :ref:`Radio Control Systems <common-rc-systems>` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接到 T1，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设为 “4”。在 "
"ArduPilot 中任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详见 :ref:`遥控系统 <common-rc-"
"systems>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcuf405pro.rst:62
#: 05162bc88ecd48b09731aa8aea664440 3ce396e1164b4a099e91d30892479f7c
#: 702d4737fc5d4c2aaa5d125d28d3d167 991345564ad9407184f824a2d9d88efc
#: c7719d0e11de4bcfb268e3ba0478f34c
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcuf405pro.rst:63
#: 3dc6b4b556bb4cd6a4d05386bc2fee41 66a0f62dcdf741c4a2a888cec2870d25
#: a0a7806127594232bcac6aef48995ddc af6be9a9b8a1490abad3397a05430670
#: fe85ab863ac244c9a786cbd018a76cfa
msgid ""
"JHEMCUF405PRO supports OSD using its internal analog OSD (MAX7456). "
"Simultaneous HD VTX OSD support is pre-configured on UART6 on the HD VTX "
"connector."
msgstr ""
"JHEMCUF405PRO 通过其内部模拟 OSD（MAX7456）支持 OSD。同时在 HD VTX 连接器的 UART6 上预配置了 HD VTX "
"OSD 支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcuf405pro.rst:66
#: 224b18745a7c42f3a996ed4c04551ef2 254c0baaf641435899acff4746234422
#: 26fc02bc28aa4b3da1f4070265ef084b da6176a6bf764804bfac451c3eb6a7c8
#: ee5181610833423c99001941dfef119c
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcuf405pro.rst:67
#: 3ff0fa104ea141c1a9edd9dfbb1ae253 8137d6f81a804ae198659a9270650958
#: 962178f48fc9444a87e57ba0e619e1a2 9beab7d93e4f47b5800b7c44db1e2744
#: fbb161dca4454bf1a979618b3a4681b7
msgid ""
"JHEMCUF405PRO supports up to 5 motor/servo outputs. 4 motors and 1 LED strip"
" (can be configured for another PWM output). Outputs are grouped and each "
"group must use the same protocol. All outputs support PWM , DShot, and  "
"outputs 1-2 support Bi-Direectional DShot."
msgstr ""
"JHEMCUF405PRO 支持最多 5 路电机/舵机输出：4 路电机和 1 路 LED 灯带（可配置为另一路 PWM "
"输出）。输出按组划分，每组必须使用相同的协议。所有输出均支持 PWM 和 DShot，输出 1-2 还支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcuf405pro.rst:70
#: 36bb5fde8f9444cc981bbe310fad32d5 bc343d9ff79248eeb994b9f6f571bc75
